algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: BruteForceCheck(n, K, C, omega)
Input: dimension n, cutoff K, threshold C, frequencies omega
Output: True if TropicalDiophantine(K, C, omega), False otherwise

for each k in Z^n with k != 0 and l1Norm(k) <= K:
    if |latticeInner(k, omega)| < C:
        return (False, k)
return (True, None)

Complexity: O((2K+1)^n * n) time, O(n) space
